{"date":"2008-06-06","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/99/ef/35814_Qes55.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/99/ef/35814_Qes55.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/99/ef/35814_Qes55.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/99/ef/35814_Qes55.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/99/ef/35814_Qes55.jpg"},"summary":"阿宝是一只圆滚滚，笨手笨脚的熊猫，是天底下最热血的中国功夫迷、超级崇拜著玉皇宫的娇虎、仙鹤、螳螂、灵蛇、金猴这五位大名鼎鼎“盖世五侠”，但是他每天得在老爸开的面馆帮忙打工。阿宝万万没想到，为了要参观一场武林盛会，他竟然被选中为传说中的武林高手“神龙大侠”，要靠他来对付残豹，但是他的梦想终于成真，因为他可以和他的偶像武林的盖世五侠，一起向师父习武。但是一心一意想要报仇，天生狡猾的残豹准备杀过来，而阿宝必须保护每个人的生命。修练过程当中，师父把阿宝最大的弱点—贪吃，进而将阿宝点化、转换成他最大的力量。最后阿宝实现梦想，成为一个真正的神龙大侠，并且拯救整个和平谷。","name":"Kung Fu Panda","name_cn":"功夫熊猫","tags":[{"name":"梦工厂","count":561,"total_count":5097},{"name":"欧美","count":535,"total_count":86977},{"name":"剧场版","count":466,"total_count":726359},{"name":"美国","count":405,"total_count":27212},{"name":"中国元素","count":331,"total_count":879},{"name":"搞笑","count":323,"total_count":640726},{"name":"2008","count":311,"total_count":35765},{"name":"动画电影","count":277,"total_count":43988},{"name":"3D","count":210,"total_count":51214},{"name":"原创","count":148,"total_count":622138},{"name":"DreamWorks","count":92,"total_count":625},{"name":"电影","count":77,"total_count":13625},{"name":"经典","count":63,"total_count":23164},{"name":"DreamWorks_Animation","count":44,"total_count":81},{"name":"战斗","count":39,"total_count":473621},{"name":"童年","count":26,"total_count":93245},{"name":"功夫熊猫","count":20,"total_count":407},{"name":"高级黑","count":18,"total_count":43},{"name":"奇幻","count":9,"total_count":473484},{"name":"动作","count":7,"total_count":7659},{"name":"2000s","count":6,"total_count":3076},{"name":"美国动画","count":6,"total_count":2283},{"name":"欧美动画","count":6,"total_count":1176},{"name":"喜剧","count":5,"total_count":35554},{"name":"动画","count":5,"total_count":35757},{"name":"补标","count":5,"total_count":2874},{"name":"美漫","count":5,"total_count":2044},{"name":"2008年","